{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! The screenplay I sent in to the film festival has been on my mind all day everyday. I keep bouncing between crazy emotions like relief, excitement and worry! Fingers crossed a producer or director falls in love with it and it ends up on the big screen - that would be awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-9e3f459680c00cad014f32b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.522109+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9e3f459680c00cad014f32b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9e3f459680c00cad014f32b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Hey Joanna! It is a big deal! I'm sure its been a wild ride. Sending some positive vibes and hoping someone likes it enough to get it on the big screen - that would be awesome!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-22b10c7be2e9bb7be12deb67", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.561506+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "22b10c7be2e9bb7be12deb67", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "22b10c7be2e9bb7be12deb67", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Thanks Nate, your support really means a lot. I put a lot of effort into it and I'm crossing my fingers. What about you? Anything new and exciting happening in your life?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-8ddc99be3c4adf8c08652f1b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.649397+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8ddc99be3c4adf8c08652f1b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8ddc99be3c4adf8c08652f1b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Thanks, Joanna. Not much has changed for me, but I just discovered that I can make coconut milk icecream and gave it a try. It was actually pretty good, so I'm proud of myself."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-0731cfbb98b423b89977eb67", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.659503+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0731cfbb98b423b89977eb67", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0731cfbb98b423b89977eb67", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Looks delish! Glad you tried something new and it went well. What did you think of it?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-569809eb661b37ee5e1c7158", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.676508+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "569809eb661b37ee5e1c7158", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "569809eb661b37ee5e1c7158", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Super good! It was rich and creamy - might be my new favorite snack!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-f58eedf8d4a461befa45b032", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.687026+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f58eedf8d4a461befa45b032", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f58eedf8d4a461befa45b032", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Great! I love when you try something new and it actually works out. Will you give it another go?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-762a416997a7fff69bb9207f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.698035+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "762a416997a7fff69bb9207f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "762a416997a7fff69bb9207f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Yep, it could be fun! I'm looking forward to trying out different flavors and toppings."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-12829d773e06de912e389926", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.707657+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "12829d773e06de912e389926", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "12829d773e06de912e389926", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Yum! Sounds great. Got any favorite flavors for dairy-free desserts?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-5cfd6332175253fdf20f8d7d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.722146+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5cfd6332175253fdf20f8d7d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5cfd6332175253fdf20f8d7d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I love coconut milk, but I also enjoy chocolate and mixed berry flavors."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-ff6fe818625b1d884d1dea39", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.731299+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ff6fe818625b1d884d1dea39", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ff6fe818625b1d884d1dea39", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow, those sound great! Who can say no to chocolate and berries? I'm tempted to try dairy-free flavors now!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-7d5deb0644428b5c3b18a09c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.741926+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d5deb0644428b5c3b18a09c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d5deb0644428b5c3b18a09c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Well I also made a dairy-free chocolate cake with berries on it the other day, maybe you would like that!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-275a867bdeb2f07af23a9c7b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.755795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "275a867bdeb2f07af23a9c7b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "275a867bdeb2f07af23a9c7b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Wow! That sounds yummy! You're so talented. Thanks for sharing your amazing creations! I should really try making one or just pay you a visit and try one for myself!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-d884f6de50097c885ca050b7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.768257+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d884f6de50097c885ca050b7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d884f6de50097c885ca050b7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: I couldn't agree more! It's always fun experimenting in the kitchen."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-b5d2bf10a6c276bdf28eb6f8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.781173+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5d2bf10a6c276bdf28eb6f8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5d2bf10a6c276bdf28eb6f8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I can tell! Your cooking skills are awesome. Seen any good movies lately?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-7c2eaead8d911d758b4df75b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.792864+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c2eaead8d911d758b4df75b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c2eaead8d911d758b4df75b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Not recently. Any good ones you'd recommend?"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-557104781136e70a06314ad7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.805103+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "557104781136e70a06314ad7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "557104781136e70a06314ad7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: I just watched \"Little Women\" and it was amazing! It's a great story about sisterhood, love, and reaching for your dreams. Definitely a must-see!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-4a8d8f40f1911a5bd55687e3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.816104+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4a8d8f40f1911a5bd55687e3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4a8d8f40f1911a5bd55687e3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Nate: Oh, that sounds like a great one! I'll definitely add it to my list. Thanks for the recommendation!"}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-15cf9f5b77ed3a6bcd1a5220", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.826968+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "15cf9f5b77ed3a6bcd1a5220", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "15cf9f5b77ed3a6bcd1a5220", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Joanna: Anytime! I'm always down to give movie reccomendations."}, "creation_event": "v5-ingest-v5-c-corrected-MEM0_V5-base-CORRECTED-locomo-conv-42/session_3-517e5bd4704390291ae85b5d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-09T10:09:24.842993+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "517e5bd4704390291ae85b5d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "517e5bd4704390291ae85b5d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
